      "reviewer": "Ashley Cabanas",
      "city": "Deconzo",
      "text": "So happy to have found a reliable pump company. We had an issue where our pump wasn't receiving power after a recent power outage and we did not have water. We called a few companies and southern california well service was the only one who answered. He tried to walk us through it over the phone but we needed a site visit. He was able to get us on his schedule the next day and was very responsive not only with the initial call but also communicating eta, and what he found on site. Our well was back up and running within 20 minutes\nDefinitely saving this contact and recommending their services to anyone and everyone who needs it! Give them a call you will not be disappointed!!\n\nThank you again Southern California Well Service. We appreciate you!",
      "date": "2024-12-14",
