      "reviewer": "Denison Golden",
      "city": "Escondido",
      "text": "With my 40 years of needing and hiring well service companies, SCWS were by far the most efficient. My pump and 7hp motor were installed in record time at 800 ft. The job needed coordination with my crew to get the rust algae cleaned from the pipes before re-installing and all went by without a hitch. Thank you guys. You're awesome.",
      "date": "2026-03-25",
      "crmMatch": "Denny Golden",
      "customerId": "ade46446-91f4-4a6b-ab97-b1833f2040a4",
      "citySource": "property"
    },
    {
      "reviewer": "Carol Bischoff",
      "city": "Twin Peaks",
      "text": "I am writing to share my appreciation for the excellent service we received during our well installation.\n\nWhile the process took over a year to complete, we now fully understand why. Our project, which was estimated to take three to four days, ultimately required over three weeks due to unpredictable underground conditions. Despite our ground collapsing, your team never gave up and actually drilled the well twice to ensure it was successful.\n\nHaving been rejected by two other drilling companies, we are incredibly grateful for your persistence. Your crew was professional, hardworking, and went above and beyond to ensure the well was in perfect working order.\n\nI would highly recommend Southern California Well Service to anyone in need of their expertise. Thank you again for your hard work and dedication.\n\nBest regards,  Bob Bischoff",
      "date": "2026-03-25",
      "crmMatch": "Carol Bischoff",
      "customerId": "e6b44fdd-17b2-4e02-a1bb-4a1651ce4624",
      "citySource": "property"
    },
